## Acceptance boundary

This closes the pre-start client scheduler queue-count delta. Java's statistics
print jobs are represented in Rust's scheduler queue but their log output is
not implemented. Broad P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and
reverse-export reconciliation remains partial. Native Windows runtime,
current-revision remote CI, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker validation were not run.
No plan was edited, no push or remote CI was run, and the four user-owned Phase
19 worktree paths remain untouched and unstaged.
